  <div class="about-content">
    <h2>What is GymSplit Generator?</h2>
    <p>GymSplit Generator is a personalized workout planning web application. Tell it your fitness goals, experience level, available equipment, and weekly schedule — and it instantly generates a structured workout split complete with exercises sourced from a live exercise API.</p>

    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <p>After filling out the form, the app determines the best training split for your days (push/pull/legs, upper/lower, full-body, etc.). It then queries the <strong>API Ninjas Exercises API</strong> to fetch relevant exercises based on your equipment and target muscles, with built-in fallback data to ensure the app always delivers a full plan.</p>

    <h2>Tech Stack</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Backend:</strong> Node.js + Express.js with express.Router for modular routing.<br/>
      <strong>Database:</strong> MongoDB Atlas with Mongoose for schema-based data modeling.<br/>
      <strong>Views:</strong> EJS templating engine.<br/>
      <strong>API:</strong> <a href="https://api-ninjas.com/api/exercises" target="_blank">API Ninjas Exercises API</a><br/>
      <strong>Fonts:</strong> Google Fonts (Poppins)<br/>
      <strong>Deployment:</strong> Render
    </p>

    <h2>Features</h2>
    <p>✅ Workout plan generation with split logic<br/>
    ✅ Live exercise API with equipment/muscle filtering<br/>
    ✅ Save plans to MongoDB<br/>
    ✅ View and delete saved plans<br/>
    ✅ Log completed workouts<br/>
    ✅ Progress tracking (totals, weekly stats, avg difficulty)</p>

